 transparent;">regarding</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW220420065 BCX0" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; -webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;"> granting your International Employees access to the Insperity Premier Performance Management system. </span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW220420065 BCX0" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; -webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;">We can proceed with granting your International Employees access to the Insperity Premier Performance Management system at this time.</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW220420065 BCX0" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; -webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;"> I will need you to </span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW220420065 BCX0" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; -webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;">provide</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW220420065 BCX0" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; -webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;"> the attached Notice to your Employees so they will be aware of their data being </span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW220420065 BCX0" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; -webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;">utilized</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW220420065 BCX0" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; -webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;"> within the system.</span></span><span data-contrast="none" xml:lang="EN-US" lang="EN-US" class="TextRun Highlight SCXW220420065 BCX0" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; -webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; outline: transparent solid 1px; color: rgb(38, 38, 38); font-size: 11pt; line-height: 19.425px; font-family: Calibri, Calibri_EmbeddedFont, Calib